{"node_id": "real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021_10_HY_008", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0011"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0011_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "“The findings on traditional imaging such as X-rays\nand MRIs often have a very poor correlation with\npatient symptoms,” Dr. Sowa explains. She says that\nmany people who might have physical damage to\ntheir low back may not experience any symptoms.\nOn the other hand, some individuals might\nexperience a great deal of low back pain but could\nhave little visible damage.", "semantic_text": "“The findings on traditional imaging such as X-rays and MRIs often have a very poor correlation with patient symptoms,” Dr. Sowa explains. She says that many people who might have physical damage to their low back may not experience any symptoms. On the other hand, some individuals might experience a great deal of low back pain but could have little visible damage.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0011_geometry", "bbox": [101, 1125, 551, 1325], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0011"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_80/hybrid/real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021/page_0010/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021_10_HY_009", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0012"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0012_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Through her work supported by the National\nInstitute of Arthritis and Musculoskeletal and\nSkin Diseases, Dr. Sowa and her collaborators\nstudy better ways to treat people based on their\nindividual symptoms and medical history. This\nincludes looking at factors like genetics, stress,\nlifestyle, behaviors, and activity levels.", "semantic_text": "Through her work supported by the National Institute of Arthritis and Musculoskeletal and Skin Diseases, Dr. Sowa and her collaborators study better ways to treat people based on their individual symptoms and medical history. This includes looking at factors like genetics, stress, lifestyle, behaviors, and activity levels.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0012_geometry", "bbox": [101, 1325, 518, 1500], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0012"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_80/hybrid/real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021/page_0010/decisions.json"}
