{"node_id": "real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021_10_HY_016", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0022"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0022_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Dr. Sowa also studies how to better address chronic\nback pain through the Back Pain Consortium (BACPAC)\nResearch Program of the Helping to End Addiction Long-\ntermSM Initiative, or NIH HEAL InitiativeSM . The NIH HEAL\nInitiative's goal is to help advance research that will address\nthe national opioid public health crisis. Opioids are often\nprescribed for low back pain. They are strong and sometimes\naddictive painkillers that have been overused and sometimes\nmisused, and not currently indicated for use in chronic low\nback pain.", "semantic_text": "Dr. Sowa also studies how to better address chronic back pain through the Back Pain Consortium (BACPAC) Research Program of the Helping to End Addiction Long-termSM Initiative, or NIH HEAL InitiativeSM . The NIH HEAL Initiative's goal is to help advance research that will address the national opioid public health crisis. Opioids are often prescribed for low back pain. They are strong and sometimes addictive painkillers that have been overused and sometimes misused, and not currently indicated for use in chronic low back pain.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0022_geometry", "bbox": [612, 1078, 1133, 1328], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0022"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_80/hybrid/real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021/page_0010/decisions.json"}
